  "runtime_requirements_learned": [
    "torch_npu needs CANN's LD_LIBRARY_PATH (libhccl.so and friends); without it torch's device-backend autoload raises 'Failed to load the backend extension: torch_npu'.",
    "The final PYTHONPATH must keep CANN's two official read-only paths, or torch_npu device ops fail on the missing telemetry/op-compiler modules; the shipped env311.sh preserves exactly those two and nothing else from CANN.",
    "env311.sh unsets PYTHONPATH before sourcing CANN, so an inherited 3.12 search path cannot leak, and pins ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 instead of inheriting another test's device list.",
    "Import torch before torch_npu; do not import torch_npu twice in one process after a failed autoload (duplicate TORCH_LIBRARY registration for namespace 'triton').",
    "Triton's ascend backend is a mapping key in triton.backends.backends, not an attribute of the module."
  ],
